  "description": "This is a Chauvet SlimPAR 64, a single round PAR-can fixture. Its cylindrical housing is probably about 27 cm wide and 22 cm across, with a flat circular front face. A U-shaped yoke, roughly 27 by 19 by 3.5 units, sits on a pan hinge at the base and carries the can on a tilt hinge, with tilt-lock knobs on each side. Both axes turn a full 360 degrees, but only by hand, as neither is DMX-driven. The front is a staggered grid of about 13 by 13 RGB LED domes masked to a circle, probably 110 to 130 cells, set in a narrow black bezel. All LEDs share one RGB group, so the fixture has a single controllable intensity cell.",
